      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Garrison is just east of Gold Creek, where the 'golden spike' was driven on September 8, 1883, marking completion.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        12
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
